      <h1 style="margin-top:10px">How to run a handicap doubles tournament players will trust</h1>
      <p class="lede">A handicap event lives or dies on one question: when the weaker pair starts 6-0 up, does everybody believe there was a rule behind the six?</p>
      <div class="guide-meta">
        <span class="gm-tag">Guide</span>
